  c('空欄補充');
  q('If I had known the truth, I ( ) him.', ['would have told', 'would tell', 'will tell', 'had told', 'told'], '仮定法過去完了。過去の事実に反する仮定は If + had + 過去分詞, would have + 過去分詞。');
  q('( ) from a distance, the rock looks like a human face.', ['Seen', 'Seeing', 'To see', 'Having seen', 'See'], '分詞構文。主語 the rock は「見られる」側なので過去分詞 Seen(= When it is seen)。');
  q('No sooner had he left home ( ) it began to rain.', ['than', 'when', 'before', 'that', 'as'], 'No sooner ~ than ... =「〜するとすぐに…」。');
  q('Hardly had I arrived at the station ( ) the train left.', ['when', 'than', 'that', 'as', 'until'], 'Hardly(Scarcely)~ when(before)... =「〜するとすぐに…」。than は No sooner と使う。');
  q('This is the reason ( ) he was absent yesterday.', ['why', 'which', 'where', 'what', 'how'], '先行詞が the reason のときの関係副詞は why。');
  q('She is not so much a singer ( ) an actress.', ['as', 'than', 'but', 'like', 'to'], 'not so much A as B =「AというよりむしろB」。');
  q('Not until yesterday ( ) the news.', ['did I hear', 'I heard', 'I did hear', 'heard I', 'I have heard'], '否定語句(Not until ~)が文頭に出ると、主節は疑問文と同じ語順に倒置される。');
  q('He is used to ( ) up early.', ['getting', 'get', 'got', 'be getting', 'have got'], 'be used to ~ing =「〜するのに慣れている」。to は前置詞。used to + 原形(以前は〜した)と区別する。');
  q('I remember ( ) him at the party last year.', ['meeting', 'to meet', 'meet', 'met', 'to meeting'], 'remember ~ing =「(過去に)〜したことを覚えている」。remember to do は「忘れずに〜する」。');
  q("Don't forget ( ) the door when you leave.", ['to lock', 'locking', 'lock', 'locked', 'to locking'], 'forget to do =「(これから)〜するのを忘れる」。forget ~ing は「〜したことを忘れる」。');
  q('The number of students in this school ( ) increasing.', ['is', 'are', 'were', 'be', 'have'], 'The number of ~(〜の数)は単数扱い。A number of ~(多くの〜)は複数扱い。');
  q('I had no choice but ( ) the offer.', ['to accept', 'accepting', 'accept', 'accepted', 'to accepting'], 'have no choice but to do =「〜するよりほかない」。');
  q('( ) I you, I would not do such a thing.', ['Were', 'If', 'Am', 'Was', 'Be'], 'If I were you の if を省略すると倒置になり Were I you となる。');
  q('The more you practice, ( ) you will become.', ['the better', 'better', 'the best', 'best', 'more better'], 'The + 比較級 ~, the + 比較級 ... =「〜すればするほど…」。');
  q('I could not help ( ) at his joke.', ['laughing', 'to laugh', 'laugh', 'laughed', 'to laughing'], 'cannot help ~ing =「〜せずにはいられない」。');
  q('It was not until midnight ( ) he came home.', ['that', 'when', 'before', 'until', 'since'], 'It is not until ~ that ... =「〜になって初めて…する」(強調構文)。');
  q('She had her hair ( ) at the salon yesterday.', ['cut', 'to cut', 'cutting', 'cuts', 'be cut'], 'have + 目的語 + 過去分詞 =「〜してもらう」。cut の過去分詞は cut。');
  q('What do you say to ( ) for a walk?', ['going', 'go', 'went', 'be going', 'have gone'], 'What do you say to ~ing? =「〜するのはどうですか」。to は前置詞。');
  q('He is the last person ( ) a lie.', ['to tell', 'telling', 'tells', 'told', 'tell'], 'the last person to do =「最も〜しそうにない人」。');
  q('Two thirds of the land ( ) covered with forest.', ['is', 'are', 'be', 'have', 'were being'], '分数 + of + 名詞 は、名詞の数に動詞を合わせる。the land は単数なので is。');
  q('I would rather stay home ( ) go out in this rain.', ['than', 'to', 'as', 'of', 'for'], 'would rather A than B =「BするよりむしろAしたい」。A・B とも動詞の原形。');
  q('By the time you come back, I ( ) the report.', ['will have finished', 'have finished', 'finished', 'will finish', 'had finished'], '未来のある時点までの完了は未来完了 will have + 過去分詞。');
  q('This bridge ( ) built at the moment.', ['is being', 'is', 'has', 'is been', 'being'], '進行形の受動態は be being + 過去分詞。「この橋は今建設されているところだ」。');
  q('He is said ( ) rich when he was young.', ['to have been', 'to be', 'being', 'having been', 'that he was'], '述語動詞(is said)より前の時を表すには完了不定詞 to have + 過去分詞。');

