  q('A: "Do you mind if I smoke here?"  B: "( )"(やめてほしい、の意で)', ["I'd rather you didn't.", 'No, not at all.', 'Of course not.', 'Yes, please do.', 'No, go ahead.'], '丁寧に断るときは I\'d rather you didn\'t. を使う。No, not at all. / Of course not. は「どうぞ」の意になる。');
