  q('A: "Help yourself to the cake."  B: "( )"  空欄に最も適切なものはどれか。', ['Thank you. It looks delicious.', 'Yes, I can help you.', "No, I can't help it.", "I'll help you later.", "You're welcome."], 'Help yourself to ~ =「〜を自由に取って食べてください」。お礼を言って応じる。');
